<title>USA: BOXING-HERNANDEZ WINS WBC SUPER FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-HERNANDEZ WINS WBC SUPER FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>CORPUS CHRISTI, Texas 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Genaro Hernandez won a split decision over Azumah Nelson of Ghana on Saturday to capture the World Boxing Council super featherweight title.</p>
</text>
